  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"97\">🏅 Nintendo Wii Game – Summer Athletics 2009 | €3,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"357\"><strong data-start=\"99\" data-end=\"140\">Summer Athletics 2009</strong> is een sportieve game gebaseerd op atletiekonderdelen zoals sprinten, verspringen en speerwerpen. Ideaal voor actief speelplezier met vrienden of familie op de Nintendo Wii. De game is getest en <strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"356\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"376\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<li data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"407\"><strong data-start=\"379\" data-end=\"392\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Wii</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"443\"><strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"419\">Game:</strong> Summer Athletics 2009</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"475\"><strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"456\">Genre:</strong> Sport / Atletiek</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"521\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"521\"><strong data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"492\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<p data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"554\"><strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"537\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"556\" data-end=\"569\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<li data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"606\">Verschillende atletiekonderdelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"647\">\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"647\">Actieve gameplay met motion controls</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"673\">\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"673\">Leuk voor jong en oud</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"704\">Geschikt voor samen spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"732\">\r\n<p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"732\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"743\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"754\"><strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"754\">€ 3,99</strong></p>",
